    }
  },
  {
    "source": "@log/Something is put on the ground.",
    "target": "무언가 발치로 굴러왔다.",
    "source_ref": [
      "2.335:start.hsp:237232"
    ],
    "source_ja_note": "何かが足元に転がってきた。",
    "review_status": "reviewed",
    "origin": {
      "kind": "independent-translation",
      "source_hash": "c3b02e2d2d3b1e5ffb659c8412b017a20a20e9b25e88b2f1a7cedfe986069f55"
    }
  },
  {
    "source": "@log/You search the surroundings carefully.",
    "target": "주위를 주의 깊게 살폈다.",
    "source_ref": [
      "2.335:start.hsp:352678"
    ],
    "source_ja_note": "周囲を注意深く調べた。",
    "review_status": "reviewed",
    "origin": {
      "kind": "independent-translation",
      "source_hash": "c3b02e2d2d3b1e5ffb659c8412b017a20a20e9b25e88b2f1a7cedfe986069f55"
    }
  },
  {
    "source": "@log/\"Wait'll they hear the news we bring. And they think they have problems. Hah!\"",
    "target": "“우리가 가져온 소식을 들으면 뭐라고 할까? 지금도 걱정이 태산이라는데 말이야.”",
    "source_ref": [
      "2.335:start.hsp:561664"
    ],
    "source_ja_note": "「異形の森、か…。我等のもたらす真実を、彼らはどう受け止めるか」",
    "review_status": "reviewed",
    "origin": {
      "kind": "independent-translation",
      "source_hash": "c3b02e2d2d3b1e5ffb659c8412b017a20a20e9b25e88b2f1a7cedfe986069f55"
    }
  },
  {
    "source": "@log/\"Hey... This is a fine looking cave. I oughta enquire about it sometime. Everyone needs a hideaway...\"",
    "target": "“이 동굴, 꽤 살 만해 보이는걸. 나중에 한번 알아봐야겠어. 누구나 숨을 곳 하나쯤은 있어야지.”",
    "source_ref": [
      "2.335:start.hsp:561664"
    ],
    "source_ja_note": "「この洞窟は、なかなか住み心地がよさそうじゃないか」",
    "review_status": "reviewed",
    "origin": {
      "kind": "independent-translation",
      "source_hash": "c3b02e2d2d3b1e5ffb659c8412b017a20a20e9b25e88b2f1a7cedfe986069f55"
    }
  },
  {
    "source": "@log/\"Pah! It would take a child less than a day to walk to Vernis, we won't be late.\"",
    "target": "“흥, 베르니스 광산촌까지는 아이 걸음으로도 하루면 충분해. 늦을 일 없어.”",
    "source_ref": [
      "2.335:start.hsp:561664"
    ],
    "source_ja_note": "「ヴェルニースの炭鉱街までは、子供の足でも一日でたどり着けるだろう」",
    "review_status": "reviewed",
    "origin": {
      "kind": "independent-translation",
      "source_hash": "c3b02e2d2d3b1e5ffb659c8412b017a20a20e9b25e88b2f1a7cedfe986069f55"
    }
  },
  {
    "source": "@log/\"Man, that girl at the pub... She could clean my glass if you know what I mean!\"",
    "target": "“그 술집 아가씨 말이야… 햐, 아주 사람을 홀리더군!”",
    "source_ref": [
      "2.335:start.hsp:561664"
    ],
    "source_ja_note": "「あの酒場の娘にはまいったな！」",
    "review_status": "reviewed",
    "origin": {
      "kind": "independent-translation",
      "source_hash": "c3b02e2d2d3b1e5ffb659c8412b017a20a20e9b25e88b2f1a7cedfe986069f55"
    }
  },
  {
    "source": "@log/You hear someone testing the string of his bow.",
    "target": "누군가 활시위를 손보는 소리가 들린다.",
    "source_ref": [
      "2.335:start.hsp:561664"
    ],
    "source_ja_note": "誰かが弓矢を手入れする音が聞こえた。",
    "review_status": "reviewed",
